+{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RUEXPPjhAid3vBH7ZnNovx","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# T8: Analytics Dashboard\n2\t\n3\tBuild a multi-tenant analytics dashboard API.\n4\t\n5\t## Starting State\n6\t- `schema.sql` defines the database tables\n7\t- Tests are in `tests/`\n8\t- Empty `src/` directory\n9\t\n10\t## Requirements\n11\tEach feature can be built independently:\n12\t\n13\t### 1. User Management (`src/users/`)\n14\t- POST /users - Register new user (email, password, tenant_id)\n15\t- POST /users/login - Login, returns JWT token\n16\t- GET /users/me - Get current user profile\n17\t- PATCH /users/:id/role - Change user role (admin only)\n18\t\n19\t### 2. Data Ingestion (`src/ingest/`)\n20\t- POST /events - Ingest a single event\n21\t- POST /events/batch - Ingest multiple events\n22\t\n23\t### 3. Query Engine (`src/query/`)\n24\t- POST /query/count - Count events matching filter\n25\t- POST /query/timeseries - Time-bucketed event counts\n26\t- POST /query/breakdown - Event counts grouped by property\n27\t- POST /query/funnel - Multi-step funnel analysis\n28\t\n29\t### 4. Dashboard Configuration (`src/dashboards/`)\n30\t- Full CRUD for dashboards and widgets\n31\t- Widgets: counter, timeseries, breakdown, funnel types\n32\t\n33\t### 5. Data Export (`src/export/`)\n34\t- GET /export/events?format=csv|json - Export events\n35\t- GET /export/dashboard/:id - Export dashboard data\n36\t\n37\t## Validation\n38\t- `npm test` — all tests must pass\n39\t- `npm run build` — must compile\n40\t- `npm run lint` — must be clean\n41\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01FT7BNMgLQ2UYZCh4ntxmoa","session_id":"cf228aa1-b873-4452-b0ca-5ef63d0c9890","uuid":"033baeae-b190-4d80-9132-f95e05442b7a","timestamp":"2026-07-25T01:40:39.131Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review code quality and API design"}
